mermaid.min.js is a vendored, unmodified copy of mermaid v11.17.2's browser UMD bundle
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/mermaid), fetched from
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@11.17.2/dist/mermaid.min.js and pinned exactly at
that version. License: MIT (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid/blob/master/LICENSE).
Bundled locally, rather than loaded from a CDN, so rendering a ```mermaid fenced block
works offline and doesn't require the host app to reach an external network at runtime.
